  "name": "Perforated Gut",
  "type": "feat",
  "img": "icons/skills/melee/blade-tip-orange.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You look down at your stomach and a wave of cold fear washes over you. You've taken a gut wound, and it's only a matter of time until it turns septic. You are <strong>&Reference[poisoned]{poisoned}</strong>. Every 24 hours you gain 1 level of <strong>&Reference[exhaustion]{exhaustion}</strong>. This level of <strong>exhaustion</strong> may not be removed by nonmagical means.</p><p><em>Treatment</em> - A DC 21 General Surgery. Any effect that cures disease will remove 1 level of <strong>exhaustion</strong>. A Lesser Restoration spell temporarily removes the <strong>poisoned</strong> condition for 24 hours. A Greater Restoration spell removes <strong>exhaustion</strong> levels as usual, but does not stop the infection.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
